sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor HQ as Permitted HQ operator / alert publisher
    actor HH as Resident
    participant API as Events, weather and alerts
    participant Weather as Forecast and official-advisory providers
    participant DB as Event, advisory, broadcast and status tables
    participant Push as Push delivery provider
    API->>Weather: Refresh configured forecast/advisory sources
    Weather-->>API: Attributed weather/advisory context
    API->>DB: Store weather snapshots and advisory notices
    HQ->>API: Review source context and select local event severity
    HQ->>API: Authorized publication of instructions and status choices
    API->>DB: Save scoped broadcast and delivery state
    API->>Push: Submit notifications
    Push-->>HH: Deliver when connectivity and permissions allow
    HH->>API: View latest alert and broadcast history
    API->>DB: Read applicable event-scoped broadcast
    Note over HQ,DB: Exact four-level affected-area severity is a separate required gap
